k_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nFound in Godot 4.6 Stable. Possibly earlier versions also have it, as i assume it was just ommited while exposing the engine to GDScript.\n\n### System information\n\nLinux PopOS!\n\n### Issue description\n\nAudioServer doesnt have any methods to play sounds directly - contrary to what Servers are for - at least in my understanding. \n\n[AudioStreamPlayer](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/scene/audio/audio_stream_player.cpp) uses [AudioStreamPlayerInternal](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/scene/audio/audio_stream_player_internal.cpp)'s ``play_basic()`` which - if i understand correctly pushes it to [AudioServer](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/servers/audio/audio_server.cpp)'s ``start_sample_playback()``. I think it was just ommited from exposing to GDScript, and I think it would be useful. If that's sounds an easy fix please let me know where i can start implementing that, I'd be happy to create a PR.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate new project\nTry to access ``start_sample_playback()`` in AudioServer.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organiz